      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NITRO KADE (4) is in hot form after clocking a flying 22.61 victory two back then followed up with a 22.52 win at Bulli over 400m last time. In form and can measure up again. SERGEANT DUKER (2) went straight to the front and never headed when winning by a space two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 6th and beaten 10 lengths at this track (30.38). One of the main contenders. FANCY PAY CHEQUE (1) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 515m behind Raven Fly (30.29) in a Grade 5. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MY LITTLE SHARK (8) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (19.74), beaten 1.5 lengths. Overdue and expected to feature again.",
